{"version":1,"key":"card:595","content":{"id":595,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设你需要部署你的网页，出于成本和维护的考虑，我们会选中云服务厂商，一般情况下我们都无法使用完整的一台计算机的能力，为了达成这一要求，云服务厂商会提供虚拟主机服务，虽然看上去你完整的使用了一台算力比较低的机器，实际上是使用部分计算机，云服务厂商会在在一个计算机上提供多个网站服务。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"既然是在一台物理服务上部署了多个服务，当请求过来时，如何区分那个虚拟主机进行处理呢，在 HTTP/1.0 时代，由于设计缺陷，在请求路径和请求头部中均无法知道主机信息，就无法主要请求的是哪一个虚拟主机。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个典型的 HTTP/1,0 请求如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"GET /index.html HTTP/1.0\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; MSIE 5.0; Windows 98)\nAccept: text/html, image/*, application/xml;q=0.9, */*;q=0.8","language":"HTTP","uuid":"6d4e8bc0-153e-49e1-9513-3298235090b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是一些解决方案："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同路径"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如 /app1/index.html 就表示访问网站 App1，/app2/index.html 就表示访问网站 B"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法使用主页 /index.html"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要反向代理软件（Nginx、Apache）进行配置，维护成本高"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用户还需要记住具体的路径"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同端口"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给不同的网站服务提供不同的端口，比如 82 就表示访问网站 A，83 表示访问网站 B"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点：对用户透明度较低，用户也许不想在它的地址上看到端口"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同 IP"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每一个虚拟主机分配一个唯一的 IP，所有的 IP 都绑定到物理服务器上"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 地址有限，托管成千上万虚拟主机的服务商无法获取到如此多的 IP 地址"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当服务商通过复制服务器来扩容时，可能会要求每个复制的服务器上的虚拟主机都需要一个新的唯一 IP"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1590,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":596,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Host 请求头部"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法区分虚拟主机的原因是浏览器只发送 URL 路径，如果在发送请求还能把主机信息加上，那么就可以区分虚拟主机，这就是 Host 请求头部的作用"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"GET /index.html HTTP/1.1\nHost: www.example.com\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/118.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\nAccept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8\nAccept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.5\nConnection: keep-alive","language":"HTTP","uuid":"a739ba80-a3bb-403f-8a99-32521aa34b7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于虚拟服务器的流行，绝大多数 HTTP 客户端（即使是不遵循 HTTP/1.1 的客户端）​，都实现了 Host 首部。"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《HTTP 权威指南》，第 18 章，Web 主机托管"}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTTP/Host","虚拟主机"],"createTime":1752854397467,"updateTime":1763390834819,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390834819},"links":{"card:596":{"key":"card:596","type":"card","id":596}}}